#23800
Enki's Savannha~
   This savannha is 170 rooms, spanning zones 238 and 239.  It is related to
Meth-merutl 271, my elven area.  If you are going by the numbers, where it
looks like room 23900 goes is really room 23961.  This area was written from
June to October, 2001.  Rooms 23980-23989 are for aestetically attaching this
area to another
~
238 544 4 0 0 3 255 0
S
#23801
By a Creek~
   Green grasses standing ankle high cover the ground up to the treeline north
and west of here and follow a small creek east of here.  The creek runs out
from the trees west of here and is too wide to jump across, but one could wade
through it.  The forest north and west of here is impassible.    
~
